  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mapembedzedwe a Kumpando Waufumu Kumwamba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenaka, nditayangʼana patsogolo panga ndinaona khomo lotsekuka la kumwamba. Ndipo liwu lija ndinalimva poyamba lokhala ngati lipenga linati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Bwera kuno, ndipo ndidzakuonetsa zimene zichitike zikatha izi.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "REV.4.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "REV.4.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi yomweyo ndinatengedwa ndi Mzimu Woyera, ndipo patsogolo panga ndinaona mpando waufumu wina atakhalapo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo amene anakhalapoyo anali wa maonekedwe ngati miyala ya jasipa ndi sardiyo. Utawaleza wooneka ngati simaragido unazinga mpando waufumuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzungulira mpando waufumuwu panalinso mipando ina yaufumu yokwana 24 ndipo panakhala akuluakulu 24 atavala zoyera ndipo anavala zipewa zaufumu zagolide pamutu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumpando waufumuwo kunkatuluka mphenzi, phokoso ndi mabingu. Patsogolo pake pa mpando waufumuwo panali nyale zisanu ndi ziwiri zoyaka. Iyi ndiyo mizimu isanu ndi iwiri ya Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Patsogolo pa mpando waufumu pomwepo panalinso ngati nyanja yagalasi yonyezimira ngati mwala wa krustalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "REV 4:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pakatinʼpakati, kuzungulira mpando waufumuwo panali zamoyo zinayi zokhala ndi maso ponseponse, kutsogolo ndi kumbuyo komwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chamoyo choyamba chinali ngati mkango, chachiwiri chinali ngati mwana wangʼombe, chachitatu chinali ndi nkhope ngati munthu, chachinayi chinali ngati chiwombankhanga chowuluka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chamoyo chilichonse chinali ndi mapiko asanu ndi limodzi, ndipo chinali ndi maso ponseponse ndi mʼkati mwa mapiko momwe. Usana ndi usiku zimanena mosalekeza kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "qc",
        "vid": "REV 4:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Woyera, woyera, woyera",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "qc",
        "vid": "REV 4:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndi Ambuye Mulungu Wamphamvuzonse,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "qc",
        "vid": "REV 4:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "amene munali, amene muli ndi amene mukubwera.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi zonse zamoyozo zimapereka ulemerero, ulemu ndi mayamiko kwa uja wokhala pa mpando waufumu, amene ali ndi moyo wamuyaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izi zikamachitika akuluakulu 24 aja amadzigwetsa pansi pamaso pa wokhala pa mpando waufumuyo, namupembedza wokhala ndi moyo wamuyayayo. Iwo amaponya pansi zipewa zawo zaufumu patsogolo pa mpando waufumu nati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ndinu woyeneradi kulandira ulemerero ndi ulemu ndi mphamvu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 4:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ambuye ndi Mulungu wathu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 4:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "pakuti munalenga zinthu zonse,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 4:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndipo mwakufuna kwanu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 4:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "zinalengedwa monga zilili.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
